five tools not six (each definition costs context); no gift card balance (it is only at Shopify, and the plan says local data only); other tills' totals are not included (Reports fetches them live); cost and profit go to every role (Reports shows them to every role). Not tried on a real iPad. Not in this patch: product and inventory tools (patch 6), cash drawer, calculators and current cart (patch 8) | your request |
 | 0162 | 2026-10-18 | AI assistant, patch 4, tool 4 of 4 (your request: one tool at a time): **the guide tool** (`show_guide`). The assistant can put a **Guide me to Reports** button under its reply. Tapping it goes to the Checkout tab and the till points, one at a time, at each control to tap (a ring and a small card with the words and *Step 2 of 3*), then says *You are there*. It never dims the screen or blocks a touch, **Stop** ends it, and it picks people up part of the way (it points at the last control of the walk that is on screen). It is checked for the role exactly like `show_link` and `search_screens`: a screen the role cannot reach gets the same answer as one that does not exist. `search_screens` marks a hit `can_guide`. New `src/lib/assistantGuide.ts` (pure rules and the one active guide), `src/ui/AssistantGuide.tsx` (the overlay, mounted in `App.tsx`), a `walk` (per role) and `arrive` on each screen in `src/lib/assistantScreens.ts`, `spotOfPlanStep` in `appGraph.ts`. A screen gets no walk when a tap has no control or no words, goes into a window or overlay, or taps a control that is not a real spot (`isKnownSpot`); `buildScreenIndex` can report those as gaps. **Controls fixed on the way:** the Transactions tab had no spot (`tab.transactions`), and the More rows for Reports, Gift cards, Staff, Settings and Help had none either (`more.reports`, `more.giftcards`, `more.staff`, `more.settings`, `more.help`, all registered in `SPOT` and `SPOT_SCREEN`; `More.tsx` now reads them from one table). **Still without a guide, on purpose:** Edit item (the graph taps an item row with no id), Training run (Start is repeated on every lesson card) and the Practice terminal (the Training page is not scanned by the spot test). The prompt now says five tools. Help page `settings/ask-assistant` updated, `help.json` rebuilt. Tests: `tests/assistantguide.test.ts`, and the tool list and prompt tests now expect five, and the tool declares `gate: 'content'` like the other help tools (it returns only a note), which the gate test now lists. Device test T60. **Decided without you:** the plan never says what the guide tool is, so I took it to mean this pointer from the Checkout tab, kept to the main screen (windows are drawn above it). Not tried: the overlay on a real iPad. Not in this patch: the screen and register context tool (so no starting from the current screen), the date and time tool | your request |
